  {
    "id": "c005",
    "name": "Proprietary designation requirements",
    "text": "All Information which is disclosed by one Party to the other Party and which is to be protected hereunder as Proprietary Information of the disclosing Party. (a) If in writing or other tangible form, shall be conspicuously labeled as proprietary at the time of delivery; and (b) If oral, or is disclosed by observation or viewing shall be idcnt7 fled prior to disclosure; and after disclosure shall be reduced to writing or tangrible form, within thirty (30) business days thereafter, and delivered to the :ving party."
